classDiagram
    note for CloudClient "List 返回全部精确 PowerRef；DownloadSkill 保持既有缓存语义；DownloadPlugin 仅把指定 Agent 的原始包写入调用方提供的 destination，不生成或读取 marketplace"
    class CloudClient {
        <<interface>>
        +List() ([]PowerRef, error)
        +DownloadSkill(PowerRef) error
        +GetMCP(PowerRef) (MCPServer, error)
        +DownloadPlugin(Context, AgentID, PowerRef, destination) error
    }
    class MCPServer {
        +Transport MCPTransport
        +Command string
        +Args []string
        +URL string
        +Validate() error
    }
    class LocalClient {
        +List() ([]PowerRef, error)
        +DownloadSkill(PowerRef) error
        +GetMCP(PowerRef) (MCPServer, error)
        +DownloadPlugin(Context, AgentID, PowerRef, destination) error
    }
    LocalClient ..|> CloudClient
    CloudClient --> MCPServer : direct, no cache/staging
    class RawPluginDestination {
        <<caller-owned directory>>
    }
    CloudClient --> RawPluginDestination : writes Agent-specific raw Plugin package
